WEBVTT

00:01:29.730 --> 00:01:32.696
I founded an NGO called Misión 2 Grados.

00:01:32.720 --> 00:01:36.906
My job has been focused
on four main important topics:

00:01:37.270 --> 00:01:39.606
people's sensitization on climate change,

00:01:39.630 --> 00:01:41.492
supporting the B Corp movement,

00:01:41.516 --> 00:01:43.376
incidence in public policy

00:01:43.400 --> 00:01:46.686
and development of young leaders
in environmental matters.

00:01:46.710 --> 00:01:49.586
I'm proud of having 
more than 150 presentations

00:01:49.611 --> 00:01:52.305
on the climate crisis and solutions,

00:01:52.340 --> 00:01:56.786
reaching personally
more than 7,500 people.

00:01:56.810 --> 00:02:01.677
And I am also proud of being part
of the Costa Rica delegation to COP25